From: zbai29 <zbai29@wisc.edu>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Ignore daemon git work for selected workspaces or entirely

daemon.git.enabled=false or daemon.git.ignoredPaths stops daemon git, forge
CLI, and watcher work. The spawn backstop lives in the server wrapper around
the plugin process launcher.

Rebased onto getpaseo/paseo v0.11.4 (dc5b02f7d).
Applies unchanged to v0.12.0 (cafe4b01c).

---
